  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Resilience to Climate Change of Migrant and Vulnerable Households in the Coastal Areas of Odisha State and Drought-Prone Areas of Telangana State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the joint programme is to enhance the resilience of rural households to climate change in areas at risk of climate-induced migration, improve and leverage migration outcomes, with particular attention to addressing the vulnerabilities of women, youth and other marginalised groups (e.g. small and marginal farmers, Scheduled Tribes (ST), Scheduled Castes (SC), Other Backward Castes (OBC)) living in the coastal areas of Odisha state and climate-sensitive areas of Telangana state.</narrative>
  </description>
